### Tests de l'API patient-service (IntelliJ HTTP Client ou extension REST Client de VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:8081/api/patients

### Créer un patient -> 201
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Amine",
  "lastName": "Ben Ali",
  "birthDate": "1995-04-12",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phone": "+21620123456",
  "email": "amine.benali@mail.tn",
  "address": "Ariana, Tunis",
  "bloodType": "O_POS",
  "allergies": "Pénicilline",
  "emergencyContact": "Sami Ben Ali - 98123456"
}

### Lister (pagination + tri) -> 200
GET {{base}}?page=0&size=10&sort=lastName

### Rechercher -> 200
GET {{base}}?search=ben

### Détails -> 200 (ou 404)
GET {{base}}/1

### Existe ? (utilisé par les autres microservices)
GET {{base}}/1/exists

### Modifier -> 200
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Amine",
  "lastName": "Ben Ali",
  "birthDate": "1995-04-12",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phone": "+21620999999",
  "email": "amine.benali@mail.tn",
  "address": "La Marsa, Tunis",
  "bloodType": "O_POS",
  "allergies": "Pénicilline, arachides",
  "emergencyContact": "Sami Ben Ali - 98123456"
}

### Données invalides -> 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "birthDate": "2099-01-01",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "email": "pas-un-email"
}

### Supprimer -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/1
